+--- CableDyn OpenFAST module driver: VolturnUS-S mooring, held at rest (settle) ---
+--- The module solves the true Newton static IC, then holds the platform for 60 s at
+--- its own dtM (deck default 0.1 s) inside the 0.025 s glue cadence; every output
+--- channel and coupled load must stay finite (the driver fails loud otherwise).
+--- ENVIRONMENT ---
+9.80665      Gravity     (m/s^2)
+1025.0       rhoW        (kg/m^3)
+200.0        WtrDpth     (m)
+--- CABLEDYN ---
+"iea15mw_volturnus_mooring.dat"   CDInputFile
+"cd_settle"                       OutRootName
+60.0         TMax        (s)
+0.025        dtC         (s)
+0            InputsMode  {0: held at rest; 1: prescribed motion}

